  "note": "Standard Listing validation, the signature check it uses and the catalog freshness check move to src/dacs/listing-read-only.mjs; the Demos address and claim parser moves to src/dacs/read-only-address.mjs. The old modules re-export the same functions, so the purchase verifier runs unchanged code, and purchase support stays in src/dacs/listing.mjs. The Directory, transport, client-error, chain and Listing modules import narrow core entries instead of the core root. The bounded JSON transport adds code response_too_large to its two over-limit errors and keeps their kind and message. Both new modules are listed in the package files."
